{"id":1049320,"shortDescription":"Las infames calles de River City vuelven a bullir con problemas, pero esta vez los chicos no saben en lo que se han metido. En esta nueva entrega de la legendaria serie de palizas, los héroes Kunio y Riki han desaparecido. Serán sus novias, Kyoko y Misako, las encargadas de servir venganza.","developers":["WayForward"],"publishers":["WayForward ","Arc System Works"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","JcJ","JcJ a pantalla (com)partida","Cooperativo","Coop. a pantalla (com)partida","Pantalla partida/compartida","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Se recomienda usar un mando","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualShock","Steam Cloud","Remote Play en móvil","Remote Play en tableta","Remote Play en TV","Remote Play Together","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"5 SEP 2019","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1698777577","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_b32160c9ce6038ee5df46ddeb8a220bdab947a88.600x338.jpg?t=1698777577","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_b32160c9ce6038ee5df46ddeb8a220bdab947a88.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698777577"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_c356a420251e2e907b1cdccc9b5bb372cee40ded.600x338.jpg?t=1698777577","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_c356a420251e2e907b1cdccc9b5bb372cee40ded.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698777577"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_e3f188d271e7d262c7162c2d2f0e49cda39aa417.600x338.jpg?t=1698777577","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_e3f188d271e7d262c7162c2d2f0e49cda39aa417.1920x1080.jpg?t=1698777577"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049320/ss_1276